@host = http://localhost:5241

### Enviar evento válido

POST {{host}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "systemName": "SistemaVendas",
  "eventId": "EVT003",
  "recordId": "PED1050",
  "eventType": "PedidoCriado",
  "occurredAt": "2026-11-04T10:00:00",
  "data": {
    "orderId": 1050,
    "amount": 250.00
  }
}

### Teste de evento inválido

POST {{host}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "systemName": "",
  "eventId": "EVT002",
  "recordId": "PED1051",
  "eventType": "PedidoCriado",
  "occurredAt": "2026-11-04T10:00:00",
  "data": {
    "orderId": 1051
  }
}

### Consultar todos os eventos

GET {{host}}/api/events

### Consultar evento específico

GET {{host}}/api/events/"4a8bfbae-445e-4cba-abc2-3d6b71191046"

### Evento do Sistema Financeiro

POST {{host}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "systemName": "SistemaFinanceiro",
  "eventId": "EVT007",
  "recordId": "PED1050",
  "eventType": "PedidoCriado",
  "occurredAt": "2026-11-05T10:00:00",
  "data": {
    "orderId": 1050,
    "amount": 300.00
  }
}

